COMMONWEALTH DATA: ASD's Blueprint for Secure Cloud
================================================================================

This repository vendors selected pages and document templates from ASD's
Blueprint for Secure Cloud.

  Title      : ASD's Blueprint for Secure Cloud
  Author     : Australian Signals Directorate, Commonwealth of Australia
  Source     : https://blueprint.asd.gov.au
  Repository : https://github.com/ASD-Blueprint/ASD-Blueprint-for-Secure-Cloud
  Copyright  : (C) Commonwealth of Australia
  Licence    : Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
               https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Vendored copies live under `blueprint/`, pinned to an upstream git tag and
commit, with a SHA-256 checksum for every file in `blueprint/MANIFEST.json`.

WHAT IS VENDORED, AND WHAT IS NOT
  * The System Security Plan Annex, System Security Plan and Essential Eight
    document TEMPLATES, redistributed byte-for-byte unmodified. This project
    populates copies of them; the templates themselves are not altered.
  * ONLY those Blueprint pages a check explicitly cites. The Blueprint is a
    529-page corpus and a full mirror would vendor 7.7 MB, most of it website
    styling. Pages are vendored byte-for-byte unmodified and checksummed, so a
    citation can be verified offline and an upstream rewording is detected
    rather than silently invalidating the objective it supports.

The Blueprint's own guidance states that implementing it does not certify or
endorse a system as suitable to handle OFFICIAL, OFFICIAL: Sensitive or
PROTECTED information, and that assessment is a matter for an IRAP assessor.
Nothing in this repository changes that. Check objectives that cite Blueprint
pages are THIS PROJECT'S reading of that guidance and are not endorsed by,
affiliated with, or approved by ASD or the Commonwealth.

